EnergyCommunity.user.adminApp.gui

Scope & Responsibilities:
- Provides the presentation layer and user interface for community administrators.
- Visualizes community-wide energy flow, asset allocation, policy settings, and system alert monitoring.

Component Boundaries & Visibility:
- VISIBILITY: PRESENTATION LAYER.
- Boundary Rule: Interacts solely with the administrative client layer (adminApp), decoupling UI presentation logic from API transport and backend communication.
